      <title>从《沙丘》香料到算法与空间——感知劫持的跨媒介演化</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/2026/04/%E4%BB%8E%E6%B2%99%E4%B8%98%E9%A6%99%E6%96%99%E5%88%B0%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95%E4%B8%8E%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B4%E6%84%9F%E7%9F%A5%E5%8A%AB%E6%8C%81%E7%9A%84%E8%B7%A8%E5%AA%92%E4%BB%8B%E6%BC%94%E5%8C%96/</link>
